  "title": "Devcontainer: pinned toolchain, coding-agent hooks, and a workspace-scoped git wrapper",
  "summary": "This change turns the devcontainer image from a bare Rust box into the project's full builder environment. It pins and checksum-verifies every downloaded tool (moon, gh, actionlint, uv, Node, Bun, pnpm), installs the five supported coding agents, and wires each agent's own hook system back to `osf hook` so prompt and stop events run the project's checks. It also replaces the system-wide `core.hooksPath` with a git wrapper that forces the hooks path only for repositories under the workspace mount, and adds build-time tests that prove the wrapper, the hooks, and each agent binary actually work for the non-root `dev` user.",
  "lenses": [
    "architecture",
    "data-flow"
  ],
